<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:cfe40ffeb37cfd3470dfcfe91a7d31cc6d3a9389f2bfab9c9d5c31973a202c29> <https://example.org/slice/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:cfe40ffeb37cfd3470dfcfe91a7d31cc6d3a9389f2bfab9c9d5c31973a202c29> <https://example.org/slice/scalarEnd> "979"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:cfe40ffeb37cfd3470dfcfe91a7d31cc6d3a9389f2bfab9c9d5c31973a202c29> <https://example.org/slice/scalarStart> "555"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:cfe40ffeb37cfd3470dfcfe91a7d31cc6d3a9389f2bfab9c9d5c31973a202c29> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:4e877524b3f505c6816614b9fe84fabcf3b755875369be4c8183184f068ef9e2> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:cfe40ffeb37cfd3470dfcfe91a7d31cc6d3a9389f2bfab9c9d5c31973a202c29> <https://example.org/slice/text> "3. Between the Anvil and the Comb the shelf drops away in three steps,\nand each step keeps its own crowd: the first holds the banded urchins\nthat the fishers call pinheads, the second the pale fans 🐚 that close\nat a shadow and open again a slow count later, and the third nothing at\nall that a diver has yet named, only a cold green water that the light\ngives up on well before the floor of it is reached by any lamp we own." .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:cfe40ffeb37cfd3470dfcfe91a7d31cc6d3a9389f2bfab9c9d5c31973a202c29> <https://example.org/slice/verse> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
